            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b11",
            "text": "Four people died after their vehicle crashed into the support pillar of an overhead bridge in Cheras.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:50:32.892601+00:00"
          },
          {
